": "1468113317689105", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393901_1468113321022438_5301992700359513093_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1rrlq3FE-wAQ7kNvwEp8zoQ&_nc_oc=Adkbjfqb97gwTIXgXzGaFpG-2mKqZFqR8UqmUAabiXjbE0vZ9F7aZj315EKDFr-CoSQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuZOE3-1Mw2NyLpoC5K33-PLvMBIkODV2uMIlGZZKyq1Q&oe=699D8D46"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1183010303571395", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393491_1183010306904728_6851860163469096445_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GgLxch3gIEIQ7kNvwEmJn9h&_nc_oc=AdlK1l8W1huWjsqECCJboRkJXeYDuEnQozyy_gg9GqHYzJ7AnRaxunmcTpqZS6GLXVQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsllsWPY6LeGN_2O1rL_VdzR3ORrgNG6uj-_xkw6T0mCQ&oe=699D8A23"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1358340778764461", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473402211_1358340782097794_7615245122570796576_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dYEJdVFaJx8Q7kNvwFPf04o&_nc_oc=AdlRHmQFiAXq7xY4KGdUSKGOpQL5xH37qX5fqIrX8jKtnih3D0652ryNo0s7IphQMW0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftBGNjo1ljul-SdacwwZyAP0E1NEzQy0-Afr-QUqQ9ABQ&oe=699DA0EB"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1023722979911327", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824623_1023722983244660_6615002093131769634_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CyexCowRjDsQ7kNvwFOEJSX&_nc_oc=AdkOHTDsiy8t5lnydBK7S1Te6GV1ykv4pLsj7O4mKW3TKfu-V5EzCKCVMjEuAMMSmks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsB-iqXAt-BkcGL5p7DRzOKaLI7gxEVhxjiKvYq75TDDA&oe=699DA5D7"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1062837435691242", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392048_1062837442357908_3730609957565045373_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nKg1vxtrKGcQ7kNvwHX2Tgt&_nc_oc=AdkRJ_fuImIMvkaD6idOAIYRbMxNt0jduUlSFiYOaX7yzV7VAPucws0crOkUFu3cKvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu6VWdsDcA_JrZifoZq0I2Jw30BFz0lEGs3qEUbOvcS_g&oe=699DB653"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car War Vr: RC Stunt Game", "keywords": ["driving", "race", "mini", "drift", "fight"], "long_description": "Car War VR: RC Stunt Game is an action-packed VR racing and combat game that puts you in control of high-powered remote control cars armed to the teeth. Designed exclusively for virtual reality, this single-player experience combines arcade-style racing, vehicle combat, and extreme stunt driving into one adrenaline-fueled package.\nStrap into the cockpit view of your RC war machine and enter explosive arenas filled with jumps, ramps, and AI enemies. Use skill, speed, and strategy to perform jaw-dropping stunts, avoid deadly traps, and blast opponents with powerful weapons like rockets, lasers, and EMPs.\nCustomize your car with a variety of upgrades\u2014boosters, armor, wheels, and weapons\u2014to suit your combat style. Explore unique environments, from backyard battlegrounds to sci-fi stunt zones, each crafted for fast-paced, chaotic fun.\nKey Features:\nImmersive VR racing combat with intuitive controls\n\n\nHigh-speed, physics-driven RC stunt action\n\n\n- Customizable cars with unlockable weapons and gadgets\n- Challenging single-player missions and smart AI opponents\n- Explosive visuals with slow-motion effects and dynamic crashes\n\nExperience the thrill of car battles in VR like never before. Car War VR: RC Stunt Game is the ultimate test of your reflexes, creativity, and combat driving skills.", "short_description": "Race, drift, and stunt in this high-speed RC car VR experience! Build custom tracks, upgrade your ride, and compete solo in action-packed challenges. Designed for Meta Quest, this immersive racing game brings remote control fun to life with realistic physics and endless creativity."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vhype.tech/CarwarPolicy", "developer_terms_of_servi